&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth plus product sense; equally at home in an architecture conversation with client engineers and a roadmap conversation with client executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a client-facing technical product role such as solutions architecture, technical product management, or implementation consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mortgage or fintech background strongly preferred; home equity and refinance domain knowledge is a significant advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who is comfortable with ambiguity; this is a strategic individual contributor role that helps define where we&#39;re going, not just operate inside today&#39;s setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writes requirements engineering can build from without rework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working across global time zones and traveling to client sites as programs require (travel required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
