&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Blend is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Technical Accounting&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our Technical Accounting function in our next phase of growth. This is a high-profile position that will play a critical role in addressing a wide variety of complex technical accounting matters. You will collaborate closely with stakeholders throughout the Company to ensure the successful execution of key initiatives within the Finance organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Contribute:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical accounting research and provide technical accounting guidance for complex and emerging accounting issues (e.g., consolidations, investments, internally developed software, revenue recognition, business combinations, leases, stock-based compensation, impairments, debt / equity instruments, earnings per share). Specific responsibilities will include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and conclude on technical accounting matters and document conclusions in formal accounting position papers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a liaison with the external auditors to ensure they concur with our accounting positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implementation, and operate SOX 404 controls over assigned technical accounting areas.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with FASB and SEC initiatives, tracking proposed changes and new accounting standards and determining the financial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a trusted business partner and advisor to various stakeholders within Accounting, Finance, Legal, and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build technical accounting capability across the finance organization through training and scalable frameworks so routine judgments are made correctly at source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead monthly, quarterly and year-end close process for technical accounting matters, including review of journal entries, reconciliations, and SEC disclosures and support, with delegation of routine items to team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a leadership role in special projects and workflow process improvements, including the implementation of AI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
