&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting or Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active CPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive experience with concentration on technical accounting; strong technical expertise in multiple facets of US GAAP and capability to conduct independent research&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior public accounting experience required, Big 4 preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP systems (NetSuite preferred)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of process automation, with a passion for applying AI to accounting workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
