&lt;li&gt;Experience designing secure agent runtimes, sandboxing, permission models, or safety controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise identity integrations and SSO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with workflow engines, event-driven architectures, or platform engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in fintech, security, healthcare, or another regulated industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring engineers or leading cross-team technical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
