&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and Product to prioritize, triage, and resolve production bugs, and translate support trends into product improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help lead the response to incidents and outages, including internal coordination and client communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage staffing and scheduling to maintain coverage across multiple shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own onboarding, training, and ongoing skill development for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead projects and strategic initiatives that scale and optimize Support operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with client stakeholders on escalations and technical support projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
