&lt;li&gt;Five or more years of experience in technical support or support operations, including three or more years managing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building processes and driving efficiency across large support teams handling high ticket volumes through multiple channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical skills, including working knowledge of REST APIs, JSON, and tools such as Postman, plus hands-on SQL for investigating and troubleshooting data issues&lt;/li&gt;
